    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04:SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_010:6553ed21",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04",
        "key": "SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_010",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04:SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_010:6553ed21",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04:SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_010:6553ed21",
        "jp_sha256": "73580ef8a8a80dbc3d86990ee64699c648321cc711fad7c346b657ea7f142f92",
        "official_en_sha256": "ec0ddcd4476812b4cf919c820c89a4c4036db6d805a5f264320f7ea2f1237db2"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "おれはおれで、やれることをやる。\r\nレーゲンさんが先陣を切るなら、\r\nどうやって助けるか……。",
        "official_en": "So I thought to myself: If he’s going to lead the knights of Grandshelt, how can I best support him?",
        "real_en": "I'll do what I can. If Raegen-san is leading the charge, I need to think about how I can help..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
