    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04:SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_013:72c710a3",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04",
        "key": "SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_013",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04:SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_013:72c710a3",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04:SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_013:72c710a3",
        "jp_sha256": "2dde7ed31f6103d2e875b524f0057a82f0308454b79da5af4440184e8aec2ed7",
        "official_en_sha256": "5c08522676973a0a1622e33627de0c2e566acab79ec58208032e48b848dacba1"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その経験が、今回みたいな仕事に役立ってるから\r\nこれはこれで悪くない。",
        "official_en": "That experience is exactly what allows me to excel in missions like the one I am taking on now, so I’d chalk it up as a win, and not a sappy tale of concession.",
        "real_en": "That experience has come in handy on missions like this, so I can't say it was a bad choice."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
