    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04:SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_011:04be691c",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04",
        "key": "SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_011",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04:SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_011:04be691c",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04:SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_011:04be691c",
        "jp_sha256": "508abc8a91536d2c62119af39459b1b07176839a300672035f4d2776323ba524",
        "official_en_sha256": "06a639d9baefb59e0d157ebfffc6a5b7dccecc64e89cafd37a1bc8ba9b38d232"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それで砲術を専門にしたんだよね。\r\n後方支援は目立たないけど、\r\n主役を支える人ってのも絶対に必要だから。",
        "official_en": "The answer to that, as it turns out, was for me to specialize in artillery. It may not be as grand and glorious as fighting in the vanguard, but rear support and logistics are just as important.",
        "real_en": "That's why I specialized in artillery. Rear support doesn't get much attention, but people who support those at the forefront are essential, too."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
