        "key": "SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_004",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04:SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_004:e9d358c0",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Zairu_04:SubEv_C01_Zairu_04_004:e9d358c0",
        "jp_sha256": "701d9d8cadeaf8dcfe5cf96ed20f0839d473983ac4ecdec40bcfa7bcdec85aaf",
        "official_en_sha256": "aaeb1546590d3d20946337759c6ec7bf509676d51a6f91d01507e8c76df34cdc"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それなんだが、先回りして\r\nザイルさんが手配してくれたそうだ。\r\n君たちが戻ったらすぐ取りかかれるようにとね。",
        "official_en": "Ah yes. Sir Zile here already saw to those so that I could start work as soon as you returned with the extracts.",
        "real_en": "About that, apparently Zile-san arranged everything ahead of time so we could get started as soon as you returned."
      },
