        "official_en": "No matter how dull the task may seem, you should never take it lightly but execute it with every ounce of effort you have. I believe Sir Zile taught us a very valuable lesson today.",
        "real_en": "Even if the work isn't glamorous, never make light of it. Give it your full attention. I feel as though Zile-san taught me that."
